{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollowbrook is a horror game that will center around a long-running arc over several episodes. Each episode will spotlight a certain character that you will come to love, each with their own backstories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your first night in the apartments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hollowbrook - Apartments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, you play as <strong>Jenny</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just moved in to a new apartment last week and have few acquaintances.<br>One night, during a storm, a series of events unfold that you must successfully navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make the <strong>right choices</strong>, or are you destined for something else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you will experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story that builds toward a tense grand finale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted <i>immersive</i> and <i>atmospheric</i> environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and things to explore and discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints for those that don't survive the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The apartment episode is a shorter episode, expected to last anywhere between 30 to 90 minutes.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Booming Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983920/1bc491918a8ccad76ef2f1802488c2d46896c3e1.jpg"},{"name":"Movie Buff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983920/300c6d62ac2b6bf97319cafec95e792ddc93c66d.jpg"},{"name":"Gifted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983920/b6a915aa27804ec1413ad4192a390f1502b73175.jpg"},{"name":"For Elisha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams